                    <p>Any other services we provide that link to this Privacy Policy.</p>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>It does <strong>not</strong> cover the practices of third-party websites, services, or applications that may be linked from our services.</p>
            <hr>
            <h2 class="title"><strong>2. Information We Collect</strong></h2>
            <p>We collect different types of information to provide and improve our products and services.</p>
