            <h2 class="title"><strong data-start="3400" data-end="3452">4. Legal Basis for Processing (For EEA/UK Users)</strong></h2>
            <p>If you are located in the <strong data-start="3479" data-end="3511">European Economic Area (EEA)</strong> or <strong data-start="3515" data-end="3533">United Kingdom</strong>, we process your data under one or more of these legal bases:</p>
